hat using AI writing technologies has the advantages of time and cost saving, efficiency, and a learner-centered feedback process.Automated writing feedback can clearly reduce a teacher's workload by providing detailed feedback, and students can receive feedback immediately after submitting their writing.The feedback process becomes learnercentered because learners can conduct self-assessments online.",
