        "text": "A new powerful artificial intelligence (AI)-driven large language model called \"ChatGPT\" has gained increasing attention. Within 3 months of its launch, ChatGPT has attracted over millions of users with its ability to generate astounding and diverse conversations based on enormous amounts of data, and achieve milestones by performing well on competitive medical examinations [1,2]. This impressive conversational chatbot was developed by OpenAI (San Francisco, California) on November 30, 2022, and is currently funded by Microsoft and others [3], having significantly impacted the field of education. However, there are conflicting reactions among educators globally regarding ChatGPT's amazing capacity to perform difficult tasks in education because this development",
