sistant\" rather than an emotional or social entity. However, \"children in this age range may anthropomorphize AI excessively...which could distort their understanding of social relationships,\" leading to attachments that replace real-life interactions [26], [104]. Children, especially teenagers, are forming emotional bonds and even \"romantic relationships\" with generative AI companions on platforms like Character.ai.",
